  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Accountable Grant for The Brics Policy Centre to fund the series of M&amp;E dialogues with The Brazilian Agency of Cooperation (ABC) is a component of Building Brazil&#x2019;s Development Impact in Low Income Countries reported by FCDO with a funding type of 111 - Not for profit organisation and a budget of &#xa3;25,000. This project benefits Developing countries, unspecified. It works in the following sector(s): Promotion of development awareness (non-sector allocable), Democratic participation and civil society.</narrative>
